beforehand separates you from every other recruit on that visit\\n\\nDress the part: You do not need a suit but do not show up looking like you just left practice either. How you present yourself says a lot before you ever speak\\n\\nAsk the right questions at the end: When the coach asks if you have any questions for them, ask about program culture, academics, and coaching philosophy\\n\\nThe little things on a visit are usually the deciding factors 🎯\\n\\n#collegerecruiting #scholarship #scholarships\",\n        \"altText\": null,\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-11T21:08:16.000Z\",\n        \"owner\": {\n          \"id\": \"57371851084\",\n          \"handle\": \"troycagleofficial\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Troy Cagle | College Recruiting Coach\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/582099469_17983911869915085_5917426700666836208_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=GA0isiLNn63GReQ-APCUqH077B5SbmNDAQAB1501500j-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=669407&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4zMjAuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=o-EjOVQawakQ7kNvwHHKDY0&_nc_oc=AdqAZaL0M5I3YEA1ovjtWRVbpUUEQKqCO2atrlE2Oa7SesvV5eRmIfYLAl34husRdDM&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=mr7yaBcVy6Aao0MlkexPcA&_nc_ss=723ba&oh=00_AQRAj-saw6pQ1o-yWp3S0sLW9mIFFXv2Odp23VEnCDUG9Q&oe=6AF3CB83\",\n          \"verified\": true,\n          \"privateAccount\": false\n        },\n        \"metrics\": {\n          \"likeCount\": 2752,\n          \"commentCount\": 59,\n          \"playCount\": 59958,\n          \"shareCount\": 845,\n          \"saveCount\": null,\n          \"likesHidden\": false\n        },\n        \"imageUrl\": \"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/721701170_3741885115954309_8497540509703689941_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=MzkxNzQxMjc2OTU5MjY2MjA0NzIzMjY1NzEwNjQ1MzgxNjU%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwa