      \"title\": \"Original audio\",\n          \"artist\": \"Troy Cagle | College Recruiting Coach\",\n          \"isOriginal\": true,\n          \"artistHandle\": \"troycagleofficial\"\n        },\n        \"coauthors\": [],\n        \"taggedUsers\": [],\n        \"location\": null,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": false,\n        \"sponsors\": [],\n        \"commentsDisabled\": false,\n        \"isPinned\": false,\n        \"story\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"3836145095993704870\",\n        \"shortcode\": \"DU8uaPZj8Gm\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DU8uaPZj8Gm/\",\n        \"kind\": \"reel\",\n        \"mediaType\": \"video\",\n        \"caption\": \"Let me say this clearly.\\n\\nIn Division I recruiting, I am recruiting the athlete.\\n\\nWhen June 15 hits and communication opens, I want to hear from the person I’m evaluating. Not because parents shouldn’t be involved. Not because I don’t respect protective instincts. But because self-advocacy matters at this level.\\n\\nCollege volleyball requires maturity, communication, resilience, and ownership. Recruiting is the first glimpse of that.\\n\\nParents, you absolutely should:\\n• Help write emails\\n• Review emails\\n• Be CC’d\\n• Sit in on calls\\n• Guide the process\\n\\nBut the athlete leads it.\\n\\nIf I’m choosing between two similarly talented players, and one is clearly driving her own process while the other is being fronted by a parent, that tells me something. Initiative stands out. Intrinsic motivation stands out.\\n\\nThis is not about “punishing kids.”\\nIt’s about identifying the ones who are ready.\\n\\nWe are building young women who will advocate for themselves in locker rooms, classrooms, and life. Recruiting is part of that development.\\n\\nSo here’s the standard:\\n\\nAthlete communicates.\\nParent supports.\\nEveryone stays informed.\\n\\nThat’s how this works at the Division I level.\\n\\nAnd if you’re in this process right now empower your athlete to step into it.\\n\\n#CollegeVolleyball #D1 #NCAAVolleyball #Recruiting #Parents\",\n        \"altText\": null,\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-02-19T18:04:53.000Z\",\n        \"owner\": {\n          \"id\": \"359268552\",\n          \"handle\": \"oliviafvance\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Olivia F. Vance\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/859290891_18644342413036553_6083285404080178766_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ig_cache_key=GAu9NzMJjJk_7jxCAE6GhCnYK2xUbmNDAQAB1501500j-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=669407&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=WPc0Lm4Pd28Q7kNvwGK1Ol0&_nc_oc=AdpP3gr6vSiUBk7fYeATYOWm8weuYO77TsrxDp6Eh2iOsQKFd7Q203YMrYBxF7aRmT8&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=mr7yaBcVy6Aao0MlkexPcA&_nc_ss=723ba&oh=00_AQQL0qo_teF0txOryREkX2oK2gnZ5U-b6fSPz74JCy_P6Q&oe=6AF3B80D\",\n          \"verified\": true,\n          \"privateAccount\": false\n        },\n        \"metrics\": {\n          \"likeCount\": 169498,\n          \"commentCount\": 807,\n          \"playCount\": 10811379,\n          \"shareCount\": 3347,\n          \"saveCount\": null,\n          \"likesHidden\": false\n        },\n        \"imageUrl\": \"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/637055767_949895737706719_3656837662672261504_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=MzgzNjE0NTA5NTk5MzcwNDg3MDE3OTQzMzQxMjg5MTE4NDAx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fbmZyYW1lX2NvdmVyX2ZyYW1lLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=-UKONmWdO7AQ7kNvwGrOCBr&_nc_oc=AdrWJi8z8fewvOItFyK8EnqXrysGg8KXFvhRBnADgq_VueyPyNeQxahYmdO3xGX4sGQ&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=mr7yaBcVy6Aao0MlkexPcA&_nc_ss=723ba&oh=00_AQR0SBvhg59WiNJyTRE5t-41F59ezR-x9Co0Nj3yc9Xxvg&oe=6AF3D2E8\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/637055767_949895737706