are distracted and not taking the visit seriously\n\nLead the conversation yourself: It is fine for your parents to ask questions but this is your recruiting process and the coach needs to hear from you first\n\nShow you did your research: Mention something specific about the school. Twenty minutes of homework beforehand separates you from every other recruit on that visit\n\nDress the part: You do not need a suit but do not show up looking like you just left practice either. How you present yourself says a lot before you ever speak\n\nAsk the right questions at the end: When the coach asks if you have any questions for them, ask about program culture, academics, and coaching philosophy\n\nThe little things on a visit are usually the deciding factors 🎯\n\n#collegerecruiting #scholarship #scholarships","altText":null,"createdAt":"2026-06-11T21:08:16.000Z","owner":{"id":"57371851084","handle":"troycagleofficial","displayName":"Troy Cagle | College Recruiting Coach","avatarUrl":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/582099469_17983911869915085_5917426700666836208_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=GA0isiLNn63GReQ-APCUqH077B5SbmNDAQAB1501500j-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=669407&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4zMjAuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=o-EjOVQawakQ7kNvwHHKDY0&_nc_oc=AdqAZaL0M5I3YEA1ovjtWRVbpUUEQKqCO2atrlE2Oa7SesvV5eRmIfYLAl34husRdDM&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=mr7yaBcVy6Aao0MlkexPcA&_nc_ss=723ba&oh=00_AQRAj-saw6pQ1o-yWp3S0sLW9mIFFXv2Odp23VEnCDUG9Q&oe=6AF3CB83","verified":true,"privateAccount":false},"metrics":{"likeCount":2752,"commentCount":59,"playCount":59958,"shareCount":845,"saveCount":null,"likesHidden":false},"imageUrl":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/721701170_3741885115954309_8497540509703689941_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=MzkxNzQxMjc2OTU5MjY2MjA0NzIzMjY1NzEwNjQ1MzgxNjU%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW